---
source: crates/scriptvox/tests/exit_table.rs
expression: "table.join(\"\\n\")"
---
 0 OK                 ok, also a detached start
 1 ERROR              error, fixable
 2 USAGE              usage error
 3 GATE_FAILED        a quality gate failed
 4 APPROVAL_NEEDED    approval needed for this plan
 5 PROVIDER_RETRYABLE provider error, retry is safe
 6 UNCONFIRMED_CHARGE unconfirmed charge, do NOT retry
 7 WATCHDOG_KILL      watchdog killed a stalled step
 8 CANCELLED          cancelled
 9 STILL_RUNNING      still running (wait timeout only)
10 NEEDS_INPUT        needs input from a human or the agent
70 INTERNAL           internal bug
